          "identification_status": "contextual_provisional",
          "interpretation_note": "崔鴻附傳敘其修史、尋卒及追贈。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-weishu-weishou-067-wei67:p004",
      "text": "子子元，祕書郎。後永安中，乃奏其父書，曰：「臣亡考故散騎常侍、給事黃門侍郎、前將軍、齊州大中正鴻，",
      "text_layer": "received_chapter",
      "annotation_status": "in_progress",
      "mentions": [
